# Noxentra TUI Rules

- Keep all visual styling in `src/noxentra/tui/app.tcss` rather than scattering inline styles.
- Keep `NoxentraApp` (`src/noxentra/tui/app.py`) and screens (`src/noxentra/tui/screens/`) responsive and non-blocking (use `@work(thread=True)` for network/IO checks).
- Test UI changes with Textual's `NoxentraApp().run_test()` pilot in `tests/test_tui_*.py`.
